				 <i><span class="en">Auct. Priap. 37</span></i>
			.—<b>Transf.</b>, of plants, <i>leafy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genus tithymali comosissimum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					26, 8, 45, § 71</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">16, 6, 8,
				§ 22</span></i>.</div>
